# Devi workflow rules

- Create or identify a GitHub Issue before corrections, improvements, or features.
- Work on a dedicated branch for each Issue.
- Open a Pull Request for every deployable change.
- Reference the Issue in the PR with Closes, Fixes, or Refs #number.
- Do not deploy directly from local edits without explicit emergency approval.
- Verify build, lint, accessibility, performance, SEO/GEO, motion, observability, and tests before review.
- Do not publish client-facing copy or visual changes before explicit approval.
